  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Stable release of the opt-in Ollama Phonon TTS provider with zero-configuration AddOllamaSpeech(), automatic endpoint resolution, WAV/PCM streaming, cancellation, and explicit HTTP errors. Community reports confirm WAV generation and playback on Apple M2/.NET 8 and M2 Max/.NET 10 using preview.5. Ollama speech requires a supported Apple Silicon/MLX server; Windows/Linux server support remains pending upstream. Includes opt-in Parakeet and Whisper STT providers and refreshed central Microsoft.Extensions/OpenTelemetry versions; existing project-level overrides remain, including Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection 10.0.12 in ElBruno.Speech.OpenTelemetry. Pipeline defaults and audio-conversion requirements are unchanged. No model weights or voices are bundled. See https://github.com/elbruno/ElBruno.Speech/releases/tag/v1.6.0 for evidence and limitations.",
